ms/v1/","context":{"app_id":3124190,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3124190","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:34:35Z","value":3,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5235310","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3124190-1846651706691503","game_id":"steam-3124190","kind":"announcement","title":"🔥 Steam Next Fest has already begun! Play the demo for The Spellbook","summary":"It’s official! Steam Next Fest is underway, and now is the perfect time to discover The Spellbook. If you haven’t tried what we have in store for you yet, the free demo is waiting for you right now on our store page!How can you help us succeed at the festival?• Try the demo today: Download it, play it, and let us know how your experience went.• Add it to your Wishlist: If you like what you play, click “Add to Wishlist.” This small gesture is what helps us the most in gaining visibility among tho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:01:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691503","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3124190-1846018067929650","game_id":"steam-3124190","kind":"announcement","title":"🏝️ “Stranded & Naked” is finally available! + Special Offers","summary":"The day has finally arrived! We’re thrilled to announce that Stranded & Naked is now officially on sale on Steam.What would you do if you were shipwrecked on a deserted tropical island… and your only companion was the person who made your life miserable in high school? It’s time to find out.From enemies to… something much more intimate?In Stranded & Naked, survival is only half the challenge. You’ll have to manage day-to-day life, but the nights on the island will get much more naughty:• Survive","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:21:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929650","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3124190-1845383656386746","game_id":"steam-3124190","kind":"announcement","title":"The SpellBook DEMO is now available on Steam!","summary":"Hello everyone!The time has come! You can finally dive into the world of The SpellBook and play the first chapters of our AVN completely free.We want to build the best possible version of the game, and to do that, your feedback is the most important thing. We want to know what you liked, what could be improved, and what impressions you took away from this first experience.Every comment means a lot to us!How to play and help us:Download the demo directly from our Steam page.Play at your own pace ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T15:23:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386746","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3124190-1844115010495649","game_id":"steam-3124190","kind":"announcement","title":"Parasite Black Manga Release + Big Discounts!","summary":"Hello, everyone!We have some exciting news to share. The dark and twisted world of Parasite Black is expanding!The official Parasite Black manga DLC goes on sale this Monday, September 21.To celebrate this launch, we’re offering huge discounts. Whether you want to dive into the story for the first time or complete your collection, now is the perfect time.Here’s what’s in store for you this Monday:Discount on the base game and its DLCsNew manga DLC, with a launch discountIf you like our other gam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T17:41:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495649","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3124190-1839676055894079","game_id":"steam-3124190","kind":"announcement","title":"Discover the Secrets of The SpellBook!","summary":"What is The SpellBook about?Bound to a forbidden spellbook, you gain the power to uncover secrets and influence those around you. Shape your story through complex relationships, power dynamics, and betrayal as every decision leads you further into a dangerous, choice-driven mature adventure.Will you embrace control and bend others to your will, or will you lose yourself in temptation and chaos? Perhaps you’ll seek a deeper connection in a world driven by intense desires. The choice is yours.Key ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T07:55:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055894079","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3124190-1838407329259368","game_id":"steam-3124190","kind":"announcement","title":"We have some incredibly exciting news!","summary":"Hello everyone! Our next game, Risky Business, is launching on August 20th! If you want a taste of what is coming, you can download and play the free playable demo right now on our Steam store page!What is Risky Business?A thrilling adult game where every touch brings stunning beauties to life. Unlock animated scenes, expand your gallery, and enjoy a sleek, exciting experience you can play with just one hand. This journey is packed with fun stories, gorgeous girls, and sensual images. What conte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T12:30:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329259368","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3124190-1836506165580730","game_id":"steam-3124190","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog: Upgraded Animations Sneak Peek!","summary":"Hey everyone!Production on The Spellbook is moving forward at full speed. Today, we want to share a very exciting update regarding the visual quality of the game.We have been working hard on upgrading and polishing our character animations. Our main goal is to make every interaction much more fluid, realistic, and immersive. We want the final experience to look better than ever, and these new improvements completely change the vibe of the scenes.Take a look at the preview videos below to see the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T13:58:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165580730","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3124190-1832700592788922","game_id":"steam-3124190","kind":"announcement","title":"Stranded & Naked Demo is Now Available!","summary":"Hello everyone! Have you tried the demo for our upcoming game, Stranded & Naked, yet? No? What are you waiting for?Stranded on a tropical island with your old high school bully... Time to settle the score with her, and the best way to do that is with plenty of steamy, hate-fueled sex!You can find it here:We’d love to hear your thoughts and suggestions. That’s why we’re reading your posts on the forum!Remember that you can follow our Steam page, where you’ll see new games coming out very soon tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-14T12:14:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592788922","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3124190-1831432155576802","game_id":"steam-3124190","kind":"announcement","title":"And… it’s BACK!!!","summary":"It’s been 3 years.3 years of uncertainty, setbacks, and honestly... a full rollercoaster of emotions behind the scenes. There were moments this project could’ve died more than once. But it didn’t. ow, I finally have full ownership of The Spellbook — and like I said before: I’m finishing this game.This update marks a real turning point:~500 new renders~10,000 words of new contentFull transition to Ren’PyMusic and SFX now starting to get implementedNo animations yet, I focused on rebuilding the co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T07:45:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155576802","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3124190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3124190":"2026-10-26T10:16:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3124190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:06Z"},"5235310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:16:07Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3124190","app_id":3124190,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/